# Enforce LF line endings for all text files on every platform.
# C# multi-line raw string literals ("""...""") embed the source file's
# actual line endings, so a CRLF checkout on Windows would emit "\r\n"
# inside generated SVG/CSS and break line-ending assertions in tests.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.dll binary
*.dbg binary
*.o binary
